# 统一行尾策略
#
# 背景（2026-09-23 实测，共约 691 个受跟踪文本文件）：
#   i/lf  w/lf    511  正常
#   i/lf  w/crlf   83  core.autocrlf=true 检出为 CRLF，blob 是 LF
#   i/crlf w/crlf  80  blob 本身就是 CRLF（上游作者的提交）
#   i/mixed w/mixed 14  blob 真是混用行尾
#   i/lf  w/mixed   3  同上
#
# 行尾混用已导致本地补丁层两次静默失效（字节级匹配不命中），故在此一次性统一。
# 目标：仓库内一律 LF。
#
# 说明：本文件引入后执行 `git add --renormalize .` 会产生一次
# 仅含行尾变更的提交（约 97 个文件）。该提交已登记在 .git-blame-ignore-revs，
# `git blame --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs` 可跳过它。

* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff ----
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.svg   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.tar   binary
*.7z    binary
*.db    binary
*.sqlite binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.so    binary
*.dylib binary
*.mp3   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.wav   binary
*.webm  binary

# ---- 以下类型强制 LF，防止被本地 core.autocrlf 覆盖 ----
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.ts    text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
